    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 N grid containing cherries, empty cells, and blocked cells, determine the maximum number of cherries that can be collected by traveling from the top-left corner to the bottom-right corner and then returning to the starting cell without collecting the same cherry more than once.",
